    "html": "<p>Sand falls vertically at a constant rate of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> kg s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> onto a horizontal tray. The sand hits the tray with a speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> and comes to rest immediately. What is the average force exerted by the falling sand on the tray?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2} R v^2\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2 R v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{v}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
